     - Otherwise the override value wins (lists replace lists wholesale).
     - An override value of ``None`` removes the key, at any nesting level.
-    - Neither input is modified, and the result shares no mutable
-      objects with either input.
+    - Neither input is modified, and the result shares no dicts or lists
+      with either input.
     """
-    result = copy.deepcopy(base)
+    return _merge_into(_copy_containers(base), override)
+
